# A22 diagnostic

Identify whether a client that already selected KeyRelease and ButtonPress on a focused window can coexist with a second client selecting ButtonRelease on the same window under this Xvfb server, then verify which event recipient observes XTEST release. Repeat the same setup with root event selection as a separate arm. Capture X protocol errors and exact event streams.

This is a no-product diagnostic on private Xvfb only. No physical input, game, or model. One construction invocation; no scored allocation reuse.
